    "dnsreaper": "punk-security/dnsReaper signatures at main, read 2026-10-06 -- used only to cross-check which CNAME target a provider hands out; no fingerprint text is taken from it",
    "ciotx-threads": "Comments in the can-i-take-over-xyz issue threads linked from the README (issues 14, 32, 40, 44, 69, 170, 183, 231, 240), read 2026-10-06. Reports by individual researchers, not re-tested here."
